  "description": "Renderer hotmart (v1.9, issue #137): deterministic plain-text profile paste-source from a PlatformProfile slice. Hotmart is a paste platform (D9) — the artifact IS the text to paste into the storefront's profile body [? — unverified surface, pending skill]. Pure function of the SSOT — no network, no AI, no randomness. Fees/eligibility per the official legal texts (fetched 2026-10-05): skills/hotmart/research/SOTA-2026.md.",
